## Urban E2E dev session (P8-03/04 · P15-W-D2)

Playwright urban smoke uses two complementary mechanisms:

| Host                          | Mechanism                                                                               | Used by      |
| ----------------------------- | --------------------------------------------------------------------------------------- | ------------ |
| `urban-owner.localhost:3000`  | BFF login (`+15550004001` / OTP `1234`) + optional middleware bypass for SSR-only paths | SMK-P15-W-D2 |
| `urban-member.localhost:3000` | Middleware dev bypass → `resolveBootstrapAppSessionForHost` member profile              | SMK-P8-04    |

When `URBAN_SMOKE_E2E_SEED=1`, API memory identity seeds owner `…0401` and member `…0402` on tenant `…000004`. Wizard template is bootstrapped on API start (`bootstrapUrbanWizardTemplateIfNeeded`).

Web middleware (`shouldBypassMiddlewareForDevE2eHost`) forwards protected routes for `urban-owner` / `urban-member` labels when `ALLOW_DEV_WEB_SESSION=true`, so page-level CASL guards run without owner-only cookie gate blocking members.

### SMK-P15-W-D2 wizard fill contract

Urban minimal template requires all `URBAN_FIELD_REGISTRY` required paths on step `urban_tour` before `validateDraftSync` allows Continue. Playwright helper `fillUrbanWizardTourDetails` fills via `data-field-path` markers (golden fixture: `urban-tour-minimal.json`).

`WorkspaceWizardHost` coerces `kind: "number"` fields (e.g. `tour.capacity`) to JSON numbers in draft state so platform `validateDraftSync` passes (`CANONICAL_TYPE_MISMATCH` when stored as strings).

Post-create assertion checks BFF canonical `data.tour.title`, then operator `/tours` list title via `urban.tourList.extractTourListProjection` (`packages/workspaces/urban/src/list/tour-list-projection.ts`).

Urban e2e smoke builds `@app-tour/workspace-urban` before starting API (`smoke-urban-e2e-servers.mjs`) — API resolves plugin from `dist/`.
